Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given his temperament,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,he won't forgive me for the bet we made earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have served the Sky Demon Country for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:05.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:07.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Demon Emperor will forgive me !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:10.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:12.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jin Wuxu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:13.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:14.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:22.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone else is interfering ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:23.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This power...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:25.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:32.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 15th strike !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:42.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, I prayed to the Ancient Demon in the Dragon Pool for years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:44.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,before I could suppress my defying heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:47.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy dares to reach Ascendant through his own defying heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:48.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's got some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:02.14,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(327,540)\fad(300,300)}Demon Spirit Land's Entrance\NEast Demon Spirit Sea\NPlanet Tian Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:05.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Divine Retribution !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:08.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who can summon such a tribulation !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.94,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(355,465)}Blood Ancestor\NNirvana Cleanser
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:13.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why would a tribulation fall in the Demon Spirit Land ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:15.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xi Xue is still there !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:15.02,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: Yao Xixue's nickname
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:18.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tribulation in the East Demon Spirit Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:20.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,is somehow affecting the fate of planet Tian Yun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:26.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a lightning tribulation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:28.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this kid survives it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:29.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,the law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have trouble dealing with his Ascendant cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:33.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one can touch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:35.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,my obsession !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:38.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cultivated the Dao for 700 years
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:41.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,and somehow I keep encountering these tribulations !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:44.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demonic Transformation !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:53.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Accept your fate and stay mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:54.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,or defy it to become immortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the heavens want to kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:10.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:13.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,destroy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:38.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,actually withstood the tribulation !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:48.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,He turned celestial spiritual energy into demonic energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's using his defying intent to resist the tribulation !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't given up back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could be like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:59.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,carving a path of cultivation where we defy the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The law of the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:10.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,will definitely not let this slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:13.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven's Might !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kid is just reaching Ascendant through defiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:21.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why would it summon a second tribulation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:23.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that his obsession
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:25.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,must absolutely be destroyed by the Heaven's Might !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:27.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that's the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,the entire Sky Demon City will be buried with him !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Had I known...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:34.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have allowed him to undergo this tribulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven's Might is locked on him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:40.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't move him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:41.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's coming !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:47.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:48.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,evacuate immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Run !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:03.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:06.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven's Might is still increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:12.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Venerable Ancestors,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:14.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,please save the Sky Demon Country !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:20.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,You little rascal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:22.14,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(364,448)}Sky Demon Country's Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,how long have I been in seclusion ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:23.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sky is already falling on us !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a long story,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:26.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,save the population first !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spatial Relocation !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:44.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must leave this place for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:54.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm a descendant of the Ancient Demons
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:56.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,who transcended the law of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:07:58.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,This means I also am free from the law of the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:07:59.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:01.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me test this shitty Divine Retribution !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,The heavens can't shake my Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:36.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,so they will try to eradicate my existence !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:39.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can destroy my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they can't destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:44.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Dao Heart !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:16.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder they say that when the Heaven's Might acts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:17.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one is allowed to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:19.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its power is truly formidable...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:56.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I die today,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:58.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if my body turns to ashes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if my Dao is annihilated,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:07.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will still...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:10.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,hold on to my...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:22.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using a mortal body to resist the Heaven's Might...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:24.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,For tens of thousands of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.41,0:10:32.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're one of the few that chose to face the Heaven's Might.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:36.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some were struck until their souls scattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:39.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some became puppets of the law of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:45.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,actually carried your obsession
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:48.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,all the way to the Ascendant breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.01,0:10:50.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:52.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Countless years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,when the universe first formed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:10:57.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,there was a race born alongside the law of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:59.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,They called themselves the Ancient Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.37,0:11:03.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,They drank Divine Retributions like wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,stepped on the Heaven's Might like on stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,They were the world's first
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Defiant Cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Later, the Ancient Order split into 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:15.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those with extreme power called themselves Ancient Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:18.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those that walked the path of slaughter called themselves Ancient Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.01,0:11:19.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:22.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,who used Dao-destroying spells
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,are the Ancient Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:28.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am a strand of an Ancient Demon's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:32.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are 8 other strands like me in the other countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:36.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have been trapped in the War Demon Drum for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:39.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,But today, you awakened me with your defiant intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:44.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.53,0:11:48.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:51.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cannot stray too far from the War Demon Drum
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,to get the other 8 soul strands from the other countries' sacred artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:59.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,and help me become a complete Ancient Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:59.98,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358,448)}Sky Demon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,After all these years
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:04.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't be the first Defiant Cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did you choose me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:08.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can't withstand my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:10.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:13.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,have the aura of an Ancient God within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gods and Demons share the same origin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:18.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you can withstand my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why should I help you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:28.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because I can help you survive the Heaven's Might !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:30.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:32.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use your body
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:34.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,to fight back against the law of the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:02.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,This aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:38.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Soul, come back. We advance and retreat as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:38.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Divine Sense, come back. Don't fear the Heaven's Might.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:45.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Shared peril, shared resolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:45.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll make sure our voices converge to break the cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:46.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao Destruction !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:02.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}The war drum never stops,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:01.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}it's summoning the Ancient Demon in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:06.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Through the dust covered years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:06.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}who shared the pulse of the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:09.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Break free from the shackles and unite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defiance will beat the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}This burning symbol
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:12.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}ignores its rusted outlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:15.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Listen to the fifteenth drumroll
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.02,0:14:15.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}as this roar cleanses the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,We of the Ancient Order
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:19.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}The stars can be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:18.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,have never feared the Heaven's Might !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}our clash rewrites the laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:22.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Time rewound, reversed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the past has laid the groundwork for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:25.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:25.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Breakthrough !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:31.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Awaken me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:31.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}resonate in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:36.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My Divine Sense overlaps with the Demon Spirit's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:36.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Their radiance intertwines and complements.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:43.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}If one were to critique,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:43.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}the distinction between good and evil is too flimsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:50.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}You and I are together in our thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:50.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}whether we advance or retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:57.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defy conventions to shatter the laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:57.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Start strong by taking on this storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:15:03.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}You and I, Demon and God fused,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:03.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}are fighting together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:09.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll break free of this karma step by step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:09.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll turn the page of this tribulation by my own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:15.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}It's a dead end, yet also a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:15.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I choose when to move forward or retreat
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:18.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}as a Defiant Cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:25.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Soul, come back ! We advance and retreat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:25.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Fear not the wrath of the heavens, shatter the reincarnation cycle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:28.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:33.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}The Ancient Demon Spirit between my eyebrows
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:32.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:33.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}is awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,The taste of these crimson clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:41.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the sky, palms pressed together, forming a seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:39.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,is still so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:41.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Shoulder to shoulder, defying the heavens' will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:46.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Demon and God share my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:46.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}together we move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:52.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Shatter the heavens, the Dao's law, this tribulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:52.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is there to fear in the Heaven's Might
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:59.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}when defying it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:55.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tribulation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,has dispersed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:04.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Meet me in 3 months
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.41,0:16:06.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the Dragon Pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:15.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to quickly find a place to cultivate in seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.37,0:16:29.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where is he ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:30.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gu Yundun !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.58,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1408,500)}Sky Demon Country's\NSecond Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:31.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come here !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandson is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:37.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,That kid was chosen by the Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:40.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must bring him to the Dragon Pool alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.09,0:16:41.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:43.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need to rebuild this place how it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.41,0:16:45.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandson obeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.77,0:16:58.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although my mental state is ready for Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:03.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still need to cultivate in seclusion to truly reach Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:05.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:09.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,the celestial's cave is my best choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:13.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first gift I give you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:14.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,an Ascendant Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:17.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's useless to you now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:20.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,but if one day you are about to reach the Ascendant stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:22.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,then it will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:23.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I succeed in reaching Ascendant today,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:26.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise to find a way to repay you, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,To reach Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.09,0:17:43.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,one's Dao Heart must be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:46.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then, by using celestial spiritual energy as fuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Dao Heart and the domain are refined together
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:49.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,until they fuse into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:50.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:53.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the legendary "Seeking the Dao in the morning".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:57.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,During the fusion, origin energy is created.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:17:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,This energy is extremely precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the Celestial Realm emerged,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:03.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivators seeking immortality
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:06.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,made this origin energy their life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:08.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hence the saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:09.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,"as long as they have a sliver of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:13.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cultivators are immortal."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:15.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ascendant breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the process of condensing origin energy into an Ascendant Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:20.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,If successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:24.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ascendant Crystal becomes the heart of the Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,The two fuse into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Origin Soul becomes the domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:30.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,the domain becomes the Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:32.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it fails...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:35.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's the death trial of Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:37.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,The celestial flame will turn the origin soul to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:38.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:41.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,"dying by the sunset".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:42.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:51.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:55.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let my crystallized obsession
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:57.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,help you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,take this final step.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:09.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:24.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:24.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with counless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:30.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:30.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:37.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:36.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,800)\pos(1730,500)}10 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:37.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:43.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:43.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:49.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:49.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:56.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:56.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:02.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:02.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:10.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:10.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder trembles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:14.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:14.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:18.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:18.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:24.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:24.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:28.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:28.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:31.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:37.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:37.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 700 years of seeking the Dao...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:43.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:42.62,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(358,491)}Wang Lin's avatar\NEarly stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:42.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,I finally reached Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:43.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
